! Active, reciprocal, NOT port-symmetric: sigma_max = 1 + sqrt(1.25) = 2.118033988749895.
! The |S11 +/- S21| shortcut reports 0.5 here and calls it passive, while the
! parser separately warns about an element of magnitude 2 -- a visible self-
! contradiction on one screen. From Astra's review, appendix A.
# Hz S RI R 50
0 0 0 0.5 0 0.5 0 2 0
1000000000 0 0 0.5 0 0.5 0 2 0
